      "content": "So yeah, if that kind of covers that, I can kind of estimate it better. It seems like yeah, tip a lot of times home the size especially with like if it was like eighty boxes or so we send a three man crew for the day but I definitely wouldn't, don't think you need a three man crew so for, for a move like this.",
